<view class="container sub-page">
  <view class="sub-hero">
    <view class="sub-label">会员储值</view>
    <view class="sub-value">微信支付</view>
    <view class="sub-desc">选档后调起微信支付，到账写入云端余额。也可到店由店长代充录入。</view>
  </view>

  <block wx:for="{{rechargePlans}}" wx:key="id">
    <view class="plan-card">
      <view class="plan-top">
        <view>
          <view class="plan-title">充 {{item.rechargeAmount}} 送 {{item.bonusAmount}}</view>
          <view class="plan-meta">适合：{{item.audience}}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="plan-price">实付 ¥{{item.rechargeAmount}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="btn btn-primary {{paying ? 'btn-disabled' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="choose">
        {{paying ? '支付中…' : '微信支付'}}
      </view>
    </view>
  </block>

  <view class="list-card">
    <view class="list-row">
      <view class="list-main">
        <view class="list-title">储值说明</view>
        <view class="list-meta">实付为本金；赠送记入赠金且不可提现。到账后可用于体验、续时、升级、配件和活动报名。店长代充入口在店主看板。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
